Introduction to Orchestration Architect
---------------------------------------

Welcome to the `Orchestration Architect` framework, a comprehensive system designed to facilitate system generation, architecture, orchestration, provisioning and management, by treating the different systems as composable planes as detailed in the document `Abstract Composition Topology` document.

Objectives
----------
- Minimize third-party dependencies, documenting and learning available low-level tools by default.
- Critically evaluate standardized practices to identify valuable components.
- Avoid using libraries or frameworks; implement useful primitives independently.
- Follow category theory principles, ensuring continued growth in velocity while addressing blockers and challenges.

